 ...KCommandPipelineStateFactoryShaderSource.h | 11 ++-
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.h    |  9 ++
 MoltenVK/MoltenVK/GPUObjects/MVKPipeline.mm   | 38 ++++++--
 4 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 63 deletions(-)

